  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NSU continuation, Srpska</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NSU forts. Srpska</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att introducera moderna kommunikationstekniker och d&#xe4;rigenom bidra till st&#xe4;rkandet av lokala myndigheters kapacitet samt &#xf6;ka kommunikation och samarbete mellan entiteterna i RS. Projektm&#xe5;len &#xe4;r bl a att formulera och ut- veckla en strategi f&#xf6;r att uppr&#xe4;tta ett datoriserat informationssystem</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is intended as an entry point into establishing closer relations with local authorities in RS and to start down the road of constructive cooperation and dialogue. The NSU will facilitate the development of systems for the collecting and processing of data and will provide the technical support and means to manage the data.</narrative>
  </description>
